[en.FOCUS_C09_APPLEWOOD_POPULATION]
Attracting Skilled Ponies

[en.FOCUS_C09_APPLEWOOD_POPULATION_desc]
Population is the foundation of a city. We should introduce policies to attract high-quality residents and encourage them to live, work, and start businesses here.

[en.FOCUS_C09_APPLEWOOD_POPULATION_TOOLTIP]
The population growth rate of §Y[526.GetName]§! and §Y[531.GetName]§! will increase.

[zh.FOCUS_C09_APPLEWOOD_POPULATION]
引进先进马才

[zh.FOCUS_C09_APPLEWOOD_POPULATION_desc]
居民是一座城市的基础，我们应该出台政策吸引高质量的居民，让他们在这里生活、工作、创业。

[zh.FOCUS_C09_APPLEWOOD_POPULATION_TOOLTIP]
§Y[526.GetName]§!与§Y[531.GetName]§!的马口增长率将提高。

